er; only Claude Code and ChatGPT Pro/Codex subscriptions) — resolving it requires the user to either sign into the `gemini` CLI with an eligible Google/Gemini subscription account or provision a `GEMINI_API_KEY`, both outside this node's authorization per LOOP (\"Do not broaden authorization, expose credentials\"). Owner: none in this manifest — this is a live external-account precondition, tracked here for the user, not routed through `rework_edges.live_product_proof` (that edge is for implementation defects in the N60 proof harness itself, which none were found).\n47\t- **Re-verification**: this determination reproduces, unchanged, the same blocker found in the prior N60 attempt at this environment (identical executable hashes, identical auth state, identical preflight `ready: true` result). No drift in `runtime/run_curriculum.py` or the spec since that attempt (hashes match). The blocker is a stable environmental fact, not a transient probe failure.\n48\t\n49\t## Invalidated descendants\n50\t\n51\tNone. This node reached no product terminal, so no downstream artifact depends on a claim this node did not make.\n52\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f1e3d92-4e6c-48a2-888d-b1b90508b68c","uuid":"36b1a73c-b7f4-469d-a9ff-70de36986c6e","timestamp":"2026-08-13T00:46:02.455Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/filipepinto/Projects/curriculum_builder/.plan26-run/plan26/attempts/N90_FINAL_AUDIT/attempt-20260813T004357.446882Z-2a6410f98a/repo/plans/26_langgraph_curriculum_factory/results/N60_LIVE_PRODUCT_PROOF.result.v1.md","content":"# N60_LIVE_PRODUCT_PROOF result\n\nstatus: NOT_AVAILABLE\nnode_prompt: plans/26_langgraph_curriculum_factory/prompts/N60_live_product_proof.prompt.v1.md (ee8ea92eef6ed8610c4ac273bbe7f0e263ac2f1ce2381d745751b7b48ca54588)\n\n## Inputs\n- N50_ADVERSARIAL_REGRESSION: 796e197370e486990f5d47636c8c714bbf62b5422de1bbad03cec72d546cfe7d\n- plans/26_langgraph_curriculum_factory/spec/langgraph_curriculum_factory.spec.v1