tfinding inherited from N40** rather than silently excluded — full-suite\n159\truns in this report use `--ignore` for that one file so the rest of the\n160\tsuite is observable. No LOOP routing target in this node's prompt covers\n161\t\"retained Plan 25 historical test breakage\"; recommend N40 or a dedicated\n162\tfollow-up restore `parser_for` as a thin alias or update the historical\n163\ttest to `build_parser`.\n164\t\n165\tExcluding those two pre-existing, out-of-scope gaps, the full Plan 26\n166\truntime suite plus this node's new adversarial file is entirely green:\n167\t**1227 passed, 1 skipped, 392 subtests passed, 0 unexplained failures.**\n168\t\n169\t## 8. Commands, exits, hashes\n170\t\n171\t| Command | Exit | Evidence file |\n172\t|---|---|---|\n173\t| `/tmp/plan26_n30_verify/bin/python -m pytest tests/runtime/test_plan26_adversarial.py -v` | 0 (63 passed) | `evidence/N50_ADVERSARIAL_REGRESSION/focused_test_run.txt` |\n174\t| `/tmp/plan26_n30_verify/bin/python -m pytest tests/runtime -q --ignore=tests/runtime/test_run_curriculum.py` | 1 (4 pre-existing, unrelated failures; see section 7) | `evidence/N50_ADVERSARIAL_REGRESSION/full_plan26_suite.txt` |\n175\t| `/tmp/plan26_n30_verify/bin/python -m pytest tests/runtime/test_run_curriculum.py -q` | 2 (pre-existing collection error, inherited from N40) | `evidence/N50_ADVERSARIAL_REGRESSION/preexisting_legacy_collection_error.txt` |\n176\t\n177\tEnvironment: interpreter `/tmp/plan26_n30_verify/bin/python`, CPython\n178\t3.13.1 (Clang 16.0.0, macOS/arm64, per `sys.version`).\n179\t`requirements/plan26.lock` sha256:\n180\t`df971a783b9d027db96eae800e33e7bc65471b94f7a3b0a151eec075e0824835`.\n181\t\n182\t## 9. LOOP disposition\n183\t\n184\t- Runtime egress: PASSED, no route to N13 required.\n185\t- CI lock/drift: PASSED, no route to N10 required.\n186\t- No negative test was weakened; two initially-wrong assertions in this\n187\t  node's own new file were corrected against real production semantics\n188\t  befo